node_modules/
*.log

# Har qanday .env — nomi qanday bo'lishidan qat'i nazar.
#
# Oldin bu yerda faqat `.env` va `.env.local` turardi, va u aynan shu
# ikki nomga mos kelardi. `.env.bak-20260902` — qo'lda olingan zaxira —
# mos kelmadi va git kuzatuviga tushdi: Neon production paroli, JWT siri,
# ikkita Groq kaliti va OpenRouter kaliti bilan birga. U GitHub'ga
# chiqmadi, chunki push'dan oldin topildi. Namuna fayl bundan mustasno.
.env*
!.env.example

# Generated by `npm run db:pull` / `npm run db:studio` (Prisma) — never
# committed, and `prisma migrate` must never be run in this project (see
# README "Browsing the database"), so this directory should never exist,
# but is ignored defensively in case someone runs it by mistake anyway.
prisma/migrations/

# Qo'lda sinash uchun vaqtincha fayllar. Ular loyihaning bir qismi emas.
tmp/
test-rc.pdf
